      "hints": [
        "`var scoreLines = lines.TakeWhile(l => l.Trim() != \"[courses]\").ToList();` and build `rows` from `scoreLines`.",
        "`scores.Join(courses, s => s.Course, c => c.Name, (s, c) => new { s.Student, c.Credits, Points = GradePoints(Letter(s.Points)) })` then `GroupBy(x => x.Student)`.",
        "GPA of a group: `(double)g.Sum(x => x.Points * x.Credits) / g.Sum(x => x.Credits)`. Sort with `OrderByDescending(x => x.Gpa).ThenBy(x => x.Student)`."
      ]
